PowerFx Expression to convert Date and Time strings into a DateTime format

formatDateTime(concat(triggerBody()?['date_1'], ' ', triggerBody()?['text_3']), 'yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ss')

Explanation
===========

formatDateTime << Converts the string expression to a Date and Time expression

concat << Concatanate (join) two expressions

triggerBody()?['date_1']  << This expression is populated by Dynamic Content reference from the string version of the Date

triggerBody()?['text_3']) << This expression is populated by Dynamic Content reference from the string version of the Time

'yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ss'  << This expression shows the format we want our expression in

  
